 ],
 "rows": [
  {
   "cue": "a4_c001",
   "line": "a4_c001_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "放學了。家長前幾天就拜託阿樂叔叔／來接孩子。叔叔的頭腦受到影響，",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.4,
   "voice_start_s": 1.524,
   "diff_s": -0.124,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c001_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c001",
   "line": "a4_c001_01",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "忘了答應過葉護理師不開車，／林老師的電話也還沒打通。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 8.906,
   "voice_start_s": 14.96,
   "diff_s": -6.054,
   "pass": false,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c001_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c001",
   "line": "a4_c001_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "小晴、小宇……走吧，／叔叔載你們去廣場。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 15.41,
   "voice_start_s": 15.535,
   "diff_s": -0.125,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c001_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c002",
   "line": "a4_c002_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "叔叔講話慢慢的，站也站不穩。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 0.8,
   "voice_start_s": 0.926,
   "diff_s": -0.126,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c002_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c002",
   "line": "a4_c002_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "可是，他說要開車……",
   "subtitle_start_s": 4.65,
   "voice_start_s": 4.772,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c002_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c002",
   "line": "a4_c002_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "等一下！我們先把故事暫停，／用紙上的路想一想。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 8.18,
   "voice_start_s": 8.304,
   "diff_s": -0.124,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c002_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c003",
   "line": "a4_c003_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "受到毒品影響的人開車，可能／昏昏沉沉、判斷變差，反應也變慢。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.6,
   "voice_start_s": 1.721,
   "diff_s": -0.121,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c003_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c003",
   "line": "a4_c003_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "該轉彎的時候轉不好，／該停的時候停不下來。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 8.33,
   "voice_start_s": 8.452,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c003_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c004",
   "line": "a4_c004_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "危險不會只留在車子裡。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 4.5,
   "voice_start_s": 4.683,
   "diff_s": -0.183,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c004_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c004",
   "line": "a4_c004_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "開車的人、坐車的人、／走在路上的人，都可能受傷。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 7.78,
   "voice_start_s": 7.901,
   "diff_s": -0.121,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c004_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c005",
   "line": "a4_c005_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "第五題！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.4,
   "voice_start_s": 1.532,
   "diff_s": -0.132,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c005_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c005",
   "line": "a4_c005_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "受到毒品影響還開車，／可能危害到誰？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 3.09,
   "voice_start_s": 3.212,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c005_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c005",
   "line": "a4_c005_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "一，只會危害開車的人。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 7.55,
   "voice_start_s": 7.675,
   "diff_s": -0.125,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c005_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c005",
   "line": "a4_c005_04",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "二，只會危害坐車的人。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 11.01,
   "voice_start_s": 11.134,
   "diff_s": -0.124,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c005_04_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c005",
   "line": "a4_c005_05",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "三，駕駛、乘客和路人。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 14.51,
   "voice_start_s": 14.632,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c005_05_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c006",
   "line": "a4_c006_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "正解是三：駕駛、乘客和路人。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1,
   "voice_start_s": 1.131,
   "diff_s": -0.131,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c006_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c007",
   "line": "a4_c007_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "第五盞燈，亮了。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.9,
   "voice_start_s": 2.023,
   "diff_s": -0.123,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c007_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c008",
   "line": "a4_c008_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "小晴、小宇……上車吧。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 7,
   "voice_start_s": 7.127,
   "diff_s": -0.127,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c008_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c008",
   "line": "a4_c008_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "他們還沒上車。／換你想一想：現在該怎麼做？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 13.32,
   "voice_start_s": 13.446,
   "diff_s": -0.126,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c008_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c009",
   "line": "a4_c009_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "第六題！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.4,
   "voice_start_s": 1.539,
   "diff_s": -0.139,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c009_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c009",
   "line": "a4_c009_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "你還沒上車，接送的人站不穩、反應／很不對勁，卻說要開車。怎麼做？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 3.21,
   "voice_start_s": 3.332,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c009_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c009",
   "line": "a4_c009_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "一，坐後座、繫好安全帶就沒關係。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 11.29,
   "voice_start_s": 11.419,
   "diff_s": -0.129,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c009_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c009",
   "line": "a4_c009_04",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "二，先不上車，到安全處找大人。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 16.41,
   "voice_start_s": 16.531,
   "diff_s": -0.121,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c009_04_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c009",
   "line": "a4_c009_05",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "三，請他開慢一點，小心就好。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 21.07,
   "voice_start_s": 21.193,
   "diff_s": -0.123,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c009_05_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c010",
   "line": "a4_c010_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "正解是二：先不上車，／到安全處找大人。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1,
   "voice_start_s": 1.125,
   "diff_s": -0.125,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c010_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c011",
   "line": "a4_c011_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "第六盞！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.9,
   "voice_start_s": 2.024,
   "diff_s": -0.124,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c011_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c012",
   "line": "a4_c012_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "叔叔，我們先不上車。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1,
   "voice_start_s": 1.126,
   "diff_s": -0.126,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c012_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c012",
   "line": "a4_c012_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "我們回學校等。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 3.9,
   "voice_start_s": 4.028,
   "diff_s": -0.128,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c012_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c012",
   "line": "a4_c012_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "陳伯伯、林老師，／阿樂叔叔站不穩，可是他說要開車。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 7.96,
   "voice_start_s": 8.081,
   "diff_s": -0.121,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c012_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c012",
   "line": "a4_c012_04",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "你們先待在校門裡面。老師繼續打給／你們家人，也打給阿樂叔叔的家人。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 13.74,
   "voice_start_s": 13.874,
   "diff_s": -0.134,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c012_04_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c012",
   "line": "a4_c012_05",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "車先不要開，我過去陪他。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 23.23,
   "voice_start_s": 23.352,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c012_05_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c013",
   "line": "a4_c013_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "鑰匙我先收著。／小晴、小宇，你們待在門裡。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 3.6,
   "voice_start_s": 3.727,
   "diff_s": -0.127,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c013_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c013",
   "line": "a4_c013_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "陳伯伯，我打完電話就出來換你。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 9.61,
   "voice_start_s": 9.742,
   "diff_s": -0.132,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c013_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a4_c013",
   "line": "a4_c013_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "咦？大家看，叔叔的車子後面，／那是什麼？看到的舉手。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 20.23,
   "voice_start_s": 20.355,
   "diff_s": -0.125,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a4_c013_03_v04.wav"
  }
 ],
 "all_pass": false
}